# Build-context trimming.
#
# src/yuzu/mainline/.git is ~965MB of history the build never reads: the
# Dockerfile uses `git apply` (which works outside a repo) and yuzu's
# GenerateSCMRev.cmake degrades to an "unknown" revision without it.
#
# NOTE: do NOT use a blanket `**/.git` here. yuzu's CMakeLists.txt:195
# (check_submodules_present) tests for `externals/<mod>/.git` -- the small
# gitlink FILES -- and excluding those fails the configure step with a
# misleading "Git submodule externals/enet not found".
src/yuzu/mainline/.git
.git
.codegraph/
